|-----------|-------------|
| Same name AND same parameters | Same name, DIFFERENT parameters |
| In a subclass | In the same class (or subclass) |
| Runtime polymorphism | Compile-time resolution |
| `@Override` annotation | No special annotation |

```java
// Overriding: same signature, different class
